ULMTCS-1#1 Warning
Control Sets use limits recommend reduction  
This design uses 2377 control sets (vs. available limit of 29280, determined by 1 control set per CLB). This exceeds the control set use guideline of 7.5 percent. This is at a level where reduction is RECOMMENDED (see UG949). Use report_control_sets to get more details.
Related violations: <none>

CLKC-58#1 Advisory
PLLE4 with global clock driver has no LOC  
The PLLE4_ADV cell top_i/hier_dpu/hier_dpu_clk/dpu_clk_wiz/inst/plle4_adv_inst CLKIN pin is driven by global Clock buffer top_i/zynq_ultra_ps_e/U0/buffer_pl_clk_0.PL_CLK_0_BUFG and does not have a LOC constraint. It is recommended to LOC the PLL and use the CLOCK_DEDICATED_ROUTE constraint on the net driven by the global Clock buffer.
Related violations: <none>

